# Cloudinary Configuration
# Get these values from your Cloudinary dashboard
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your-cloud-name
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=your-upload-preset
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your-api-key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your-api-secret

# Instructions:
# 1. Sign up at https://cloudinary.com
# 2. Create a new cloud (or use existing)
# 3. Go to Settings -> Upload -> Upload presets
# 4. Create an unsigned upload preset with these settings:
#    - Signing mode: Unsigned
#    - Allowed formats: jpg, jpeg, png, webp
#    - Transformation: Optional (resize, crop, etc.)
#    - Folder: products (recommended)
# 5. Replace the values above with your actual credentials
